            "Text": "OrganizationRoleAuthorizationAction",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "What type of action a user wants to take on an organization\u0027s role holders, such as adding or removing an administrator. Valid enums include:ADMINISTRATOR_READADMINISTRATOR_WRITEDIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_READDIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_WRITEPIPELINE_BUILDER_READPIPELINE_BUILDER_WRITEPENDING_ADMIN_READPENDING_ADMIN_WRITEPENDING_DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_READPENDING_DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_WRITE",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": [
              "ADMINISTRATOR_READ",
              "ADMINISTRATOR_WRITE",
              "DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_READ",
              "DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_WRITE",
              "PIPELINE_BUILDER_READ",
              "PIPELINE_BUILDER_WRITE",
              "PENDING_ADMIN_READ",
              "PENDING_ADMIN_WRITE",
              "PENDING_DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_READ",
              "PENDING_DIRECT_SPONSORED_CONTENT_POSTER_WRITE"
            ]
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "OrganizationContentAuthorizationAction",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
